OL,3,GNEWSASchool overturns boy's detention
OL,4,Ain PE socks row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum said she was "absolutely baffled"
OL,7,Fby the decision of her son's school to
OL,8,Fgive him detention for wearing the
OL,9,Fwrong coloured socks.
OL,11,FThe punishment at Sir John Leman High
OL,12,FSchool in Beccles, Suffolk, was imposed
OL,13,Fafter the 11-year-old boy wore the
OL,14,Fwrong colour for PE lessons on two
OL,15,Foccasions, but it was overturned after
OL,16,Fhis mother, Aisling, complained.
OL,18,F"Putting something as silly as the
OL,19,Fcolour of someone's socks down as bad
OL,20,Fbehaviour is ridiculous," she told the
OL,21,FBBC.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
